#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "32 levels — Doom II compatible"
msgstr "32 個關卡——相容 Doom II"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "36 levels of open-source doom"
msgstr "36 個開源 DOOM 關卡"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:112
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A Viking-themed total conversion with hand-drawn pixel art. Battle through Norse-inspired levels with axes, bows, and runic magic."
msgstr "以手繪像素美術打造的維京主題完全轉換。揮舞斧頭、弓箭和盧恩魔法,在北歐風格的關卡中殺出重圍。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A complete free replacement for DOOM II — 32 levels with the Super Shotgun. Compatible with thousands of community-made PWAD mods."
msgstr "DOOM II 的完全免費替代品——32 個關卡,附超級霰彈槍。相容數千個社群製作的 PWAD 模組。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:139
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A complete free replacement for Quake — original levels, art, and music under BSD license. Community-made open-source content."
msgstr "Quake 的完全免費替代品——原創關卡、美術和音樂,採用 BSD 授權。社群製作的開源內容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:42
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A complete free replacement for Ultimate DOOM — 4 episodes, 36 levels. Original art, music, and levels under BSD license."
msgstr "Ultimate DOOM 的完全免費替代品——4 個章節、36 個關卡。原創美術、音樂和關卡,採用 BSD 授權。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:98
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A cyberpunk total conversion — hack through a dystopian future with new weapons, enemies, and levels. Standalone v1.2 IWAD."
msgstr "賽博龐克完全轉換——帶著新武器、敵人和關卡,駭入反烏托邦的未來。獨立版 v1.2 IWAD。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:237
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A disturbing top-down cyberpunk adventure by Creative Reality. You are Ryan, plagued by nightmares about the Dreamweb — a mystical barrier protecting reality. Full CD version with voice acting."
msgstr ""
"由創意現實(Creative Reality)創作的自上而下的令人不安的網絡朋克冒險. 你是瑞安,被夢網的噩夢所困擾——保護現實的神祕屏障. "
"配音的完整CD版本."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Aim / look"
msgstr "瞄準/環顧"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Aim / turn"
msgstr "瞄準/轉向"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom1.ex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All 4 episodes are available — explore them all for varied level themes and increasing difficulty."
msgstr "4 個章節全部開放——探索所有章節,體驗各種關卡主題與逐步提升的難度。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/librequake.ex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "All content is BSD-licensed — the ultimate libre FPS experience."
msgstr "所有內容皆採用 BSD 授權——終極自由 FPS 體驗。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Alt + ←/→"
msgstr "Alt + ←/→"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom2.ex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ammo management becomes critical in later levels — don't waste rockets on weak enemies."
msgstr "後面的關卡中彈藥管理變得至關重要——別把火箭浪費在弱小的敵人身上。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/policy.ex:49
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Arcade session is no longer active"
msgstr "街機工作階段已不再有效"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedm.ex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Arena-style layouts mean enemies can come from any direction — stay moving."
msgstr "競技場式的配置意味著敵人可能從任何方向出現——保持移動。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:175
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Arrow keys move, Ctrl fire, Space open doors, Shift run, 1-4 weapons"
msgstr "方向鍵移動,Ctrl 射擊,空白鍵開門,Shift 奔跑,1-4 切換武器"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_lure.ex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "As Diermot, a young peasant, you must free Turnvale from Selena's grip. The Virtual Theatre system means NPCs follow their own schedules, walk around town independently, and react to events — groundbreaking for 1992 and still impressive today."
msgstr "你扮演年輕農夫迪爾莫特,必須將特恩瓦勒從塞琳娜的魔掌中解救出來。虛擬劇場系統讓 NPC 依照各自的行程活動,獨立在城鎮中走動,並對事件做出反應——在 1992 年堪稱開創性之作,至今仍令人驚豔。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom1.ex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "As a fully open-source project, Freedoom serves both as a standalone game and as a free IWAD for running thousands of community-made DOOM mods and maps."
msgstr "Freedoom 是完全開源的專案,既是獨立遊戲,也是執行數千個社群製作的 DOOM 模組和地圖所需的免費 IWAD。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/doom_shareware.ex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "As a lone space marine, fight your way through military bases overrun by hellspawn using an arsenal that includes the iconic shotgun, chaingun, and rocket launcher. The level design by John Romero and Sandy Petersen remains a masterclass in non-linear FPS map design."
msgstr "化身孤身一人的太空陸戰隊員,運用包括經典霰彈槍、機槍和火箭發射器在內的武器庫,殺出被地獄生物攻陷的軍事基地。約翰·羅梅羅和桑迪·彼得森的關卡設計,至今仍是非線性 FPS 地圖設計的大師級典範。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_bass.ex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Beneath a Steel Sky (1994) is a cyberpunk point-and-click adventure by Revolution Software, set in a dystopian future Australia. Robert Foster was raised in the radioactive wasteland known as \"the Gap\" but is kidnapped and brought to Union City — a massive, stratified metropolis ruled by the supercomputer LINC."
msgstr "《Beneath a Steel Sky》(1994)是 Revolution Software 推出的賽博龐克指向式冒險遊戲,背景設定在反烏托邦的未來澳洲。羅伯特·福斯特在名為「裂隙」的輻射荒原中長大,卻被綁架並帶到聯合城——一座由超級電腦 LINC 統治、階層分明的龐大都會。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:220
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "British real estate agent John Hacker must defeat the vampire Drascula in this hilarious Spanish point & click adventure full of pop culture references and absurd humor."
msgstr "英國房地產經紀人約翰·哈克必須擊敗吸血鬼德拉斯庫拉。這是一款充滿流行文化典故與荒誕幽默的西班牙指向式冒險遊戲,內容爆笑。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/chex_quest.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Chex Quest (1996) is the legendary cereal box promotion that became a cult classic — a kid-friendly total conversion of DOOM where you play as the Chex Warrior, armed with the Zorcher to teleport slimy Flemoids back to their home dimension."
msgstr "《Chex Quest》(1996)是傳奇的穀片盒促銷遊戲,後來成為經典邪典作品——這是適合兒童的 DOOM 完全轉換,你扮演 Chex 戰士,用 Zorcher 把黏糊糊的 Flemoid 傳送回他們的家園次元。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_soltys.ex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Click on everything — interactive hotspots can be small and unexpected."
msgstr "每樣東西都點點看——可互動的熱點可能很小,也出人意料。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/quake2_shareware.ex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Colored lighting is used for environmental storytelling — red areas often signal danger."
msgstr "彩色燈光用於營造環境敘事——紅色區域通常代表危險。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_bass.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Combine inventory items"
msgstr "組合物品欄中的物品"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_fotaq.ex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Combine inventory items — some puzzles require creative item combinations."
msgstr "組合物品欄中的物品——有些謎題需要創意的物品組合。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:218
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Comedic Dracula parody adventure (1996)"
msgstr "喜劇版德古拉惡搞冒險遊戲(1996年)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:252
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Comic adventure in the Amazon (1995)"
msgstr "亞馬遜的喜劇冒險遊戲(1995年)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom1.ex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Compatible with most DOOM WADs and mods — the same engine powers it all."
msgstr "相容於大多數 DOOM WAD 和模組——同一個引擎驅動全部內容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Conserve ammo on guards (use the knife or pistol) and save the chaingun for officers and bosses."
msgstr "對付警衛時請節省彈藥(使用刀或手槍),把機關槍留給軍官和頭目。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/rekkr.ex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Created by Matthew Little (Revae), REKKR won a Cacoward in 2018 for its exceptional quality. The standalone IWAD version runs independently of any commercial DOOM files."
msgstr "REKKR 由 Matthew Little (Revae) 創作,2018 年憑藉卓越的品質榮獲 Cacoward 獎。獨立的 IWAD 版本無需任何商業版 DOOM 檔案即可執行。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Created by id Software before DOOM, Wolfenstein 3D established the FPS genre. The gameplay is pure and immediate: navigate maze-like castle floors, collect keys, find secrets, and shoot everything that moves. No jumping, no looking up or down — just raw, fast-paced shooting."
msgstr "Wolfenstein 3D 由 id Software 在 DOOM 之前推出,開創了第一人稱射擊遊戲類型。遊戲玩法純粹而直接:在迷宮般的城堡樓層中穿行,收集鑰匙,尋找祕密,射擊一切會動的東西。不能跳躍,也不能抬頭或低頭看——只有純粹、快節奏的射擊。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/quake2_shareware.ex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Crouch"
msgstr "蹲下"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Crouch (hold)"
msgstr "蹲下(按住)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Crouch-jumping (Shift + Space) lets you reach higher ledges — essential for some puzzle areas."
msgstr "蹲跳(Shift + 空白鍵)可以讓你登上更高的平台——在某些解謎區域是必需的。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/quake2_shareware.ex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Crouching (C) lets you access vents and low passages — essential for progression."
msgstr "蹲下(C)可以讓你進入通風口和低矮通道——這是推進遊戲的關鍵。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ctrl"
msgstr "Ctrl"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_bass.ex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Ctrl + F5"
msgstr "Ctrl + F5"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:201
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cyberpunk point & click adventure (1994)"
msgstr "賽博龐克指向點擊冒險遊戲(1994年)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:96
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cyberpunk total conversion"
msgstr "賽博龐克全面改版"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/hacx.ex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cyborg enemies can be tougher than classic DOOM monsters — keep your distance."
msgstr "半機械人敵人可能比經典 DOOM 怪物更難對付——請保持距離。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:235
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Dark cyberpunk adventure (1994)"
msgstr "黑暗賽博龐克冒險遊戲(1994年)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Deathmatch arena — open source"
msgstr "死亡競賽競技場——開放原始碼"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_drascula.ex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Don't forget to look at items in your inventory — descriptions often contain hints."
msgstr "別忘了查看你物品欄中的物品——描述中常常藏有提示。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_soltys.ex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Don't get frustrated by the surreal logic — that's part of the charm."
msgstr "別因為超現實的邏輯而感到挫折——那正是它的魅力所在。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_bass.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Drag item"
msgstr "拖曳物品"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_drascula.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Drascula: The Vampire Strikes Back (1996) is a hilarious Spanish point-and-click adventure by Alcachofa Soft. British real estate agent John Hacker travels to Transylvania and must defeat the vampire Count Drascula, who has kidnapped the beautiful BJ to make her his bride."
msgstr "《Drascula: The Vampire Strikes Back》(1996) 是 Alcachofa Soft 製作的一款爆笑西班牙指向點擊冒險遊戲。英國房地產經紀人 John Hacker 前往特蘭西瓦尼亞,必須打敗綁架了美麗的 BJ、打算強娶她為新娘的吸血鬼 Drascula 伯爵。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_dreamweb.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Dreamweb (1994) is a dark, atmospheric cyberpunk adventure by Creative Reality. You play as Ryan, an ordinary man plagued by nightmares about the Dreamweb — a mystical barrier that protects reality from descending into chaos. Seven guardians maintain the web, but they've become corrupt."
msgstr "《Dreamweb》(1994) 是 Creative Reality 製作的一款黑暗而氣氛濃厚的賽博龐克冒險遊戲。你扮演 Ryan,一個被關於 Dreamweb 的噩夢所困擾的普通人——Dreamweb 是一道神祕的屏障,保護現實不陷入混亂。七位守護者維繫著這張網,但他們已經腐化。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Environmental storytelling is key — listen to scientist dialogues and read signs for clues."
msgstr "環境敘事是關鍵——聆聽科學家的對話,並閱讀牌子上的線索。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/quake_shareware.ex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Episode 1 takes you through four dimensions of Lovecraftian horror: medieval castles, dark crypts, and otherworldly realms filled with Shamblers, Fiends, Ogres, and other nightmarish creatures. The atmospheric soundtrack by Trent Reznor (Nine Inch Nails) adds to the oppressive mood."
msgstr "第 1 章帶你穿越洛夫克拉夫特式恐怖的四個維度:中世紀城堡、黑暗地穴,以及充滿 Shambler、Fiend、Ogre 等噩夢般生物的異世界。Trent Reznor(Nine Inch Nails)創作的氛圍配樂更增添了壓迫感。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:26
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:124
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Episode 1 — The Original"
msgstr "第 1 集 — 原版"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:167
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Episode 1 — The Shareware Classic"
msgstr "第 1 章 — 共享軟體經典"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:47
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:62
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:73
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Esc"
msgstr "Esc"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:203
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Escape Union City and uncover your past in this cyberpunk classic by Revolution Software. One of the greatest point & click adventures ever made."
msgstr "逃離聯合城,在這款由 Revolution Software 製作的賽博龐克經典中揭開你的過去。這是史上最偉大的指向點擊冒險遊戲之一。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/rekkr.ex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every asset is lovingly hand-crafted — from the beautifully detailed environments (frozen fjords, ruined villages, underground caverns) to the unique weapon set including axes, bows, and runic magic. The art style is distinctly its own while honoring the DOOM engine's capabilities."
msgstr "每一項素材都是用心手工打造的——從細節精美的環境(冰封峽灣、廢棄村莊、地下洞穴),到包含斧頭、弓箭和符文魔法的獨特武器組合。美術風格獨樹一幟,同時充分發揮了 DOOM 引擎的能力。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_bass.ex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Examine / open verb menu"
msgstr "檢查/開啟動詞選單"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:71
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Examine object"
msgstr "檢查物件"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/chex_quest.ex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Explore every corner — the levels have hidden areas with extra Zorch ammo."
msgstr "探索每個角落——關卡中有隱藏區域,藏有額外的佐奇彈藥。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/librequake.ex:36
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Explore thoroughly — the community level designers have hidden secrets throughout."
msgstr "徹底探索——社群關卡設計者在各處都藏了祕密。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/service.ex:119
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Failed to create session"
msgstr "建立工作階段失敗"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/rekkr.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Fire / swing weapon"
msgstr "開火/揮動武器"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/chex_quest.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Fire Zorcher"
msgstr "發射佐奇槍"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:41
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:57
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Fire weapon"
msgstr "開火"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Flashlight toggle"
msgstr "切換手電筒"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_fotaq.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Flight of the Amazon Queen (1995) is a comic point-and-click adventure in the style of Indiana Jones and Monkey Island. You play as Joe King, a pilot-for-hire whose plane crash-lands in the Amazon jungle while transporting a famous actress."
msgstr "《Flight of the Amazon Queen》(1995)是一款漫畫風格的指向點擊式冒險遊戲,風格類似《印第安納瓊斯》和《猴島》。你扮演受僱飛行員喬·金,他在運送一位著名女演員時,飛機迫降在亞馬遜叢林。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Free deathmatch-focused maps for DOOM. 32 arena-style levels designed for fast-paced multiplayer action. BSD license."
msgstr "免費的DOOM死亡競賽地圖。32個競技場式關卡,專為快節奏多人動作設計。BSD授權。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:271
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Free the village of Turnvale from the sorceress Selena. Revolution Software's debut game featuring the innovative Virtual Theatre system with autonomous NPCs."
msgstr "從女巫賽琳娜手中解放Turnvale村。Revolution Software的首款遊戲,採用創新的Virtual Theatre系統,擁有自主行動的NPC。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedm.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "FreeDM is a free, open-source collection of 32 deathmatch-focused maps for the DOOM engine. Designed for fast-paced multiplayer arena combat, each level is a compact, weapon-rich killing ground."
msgstr "FreeDM是為DOOM引擎打造的免費開源地圖集,包含32張死亡競賽地圖。專為快節奏多人競技場戰鬥設計,每個關卡都是緊湊、武器充足的殺戮戰場。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom1.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Freedoom's enemy designs differ from DOOM's but follow similar behavior patterns — learn the new sprites."
msgstr "Freedoom的敵人設計與DOOM不同,但行為模式相似——熟悉一下新的敵人圖像吧。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom1.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Freedoom: Phase 1 is a complete free replacement for Ultimate DOOM — 4 full episodes with 36 original levels, all under the BSD license. Every sprite, texture, sound effect, and music track has been recreated from scratch by the community."
msgstr "Freedoom:Phase 1 是《Ultimate DOOM》的完整免費替代品——4個完整章節、36個原創關卡,全部採用BSD授權。所有圖像、紋理、音效和音樂都由社群從零重新製作。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom2.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Freedoom: Phase 2 is a complete free replacement for DOOM II: Hell on Earth — 32 levels of intense FPS action with the legendary Super Shotgun. All assets are original community creations under the BSD license."
msgstr "Freedoom:Phase 2 是《DOOM II: Hell on Earth》的完整免費替代品——32個關卡的激烈FPS動作,並配有傳說中的超級霰彈槍。所有素材都是社群在BSD授權下的原創作品。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/hacx.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "HacX: Twitch 'n Kill (1997) is a cyberpunk total conversion for DOOM II that went standalone. Set in a dystopian future, you hack through corporate security systems and cyborg enemies in neon-lit corridors."
msgstr "《HacX: Twitch 'n Kill》(1997)是DOOM II的賽博龐克全面改版作品,後來獨立發行。故事設定在反烏托邦的未來,你在霓虹燈照亮的走廊中駭入企業安全系統,對抗改造人敵人。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Half-Life: Uplink (1999) is the official demo for Half-Life, featuring three unique levels not found in the full game. As Gordon Freeman, navigate the aftermath of the Black Mesa incident through previously unseen areas of the research facility."
msgstr "《Half-Life: Uplink》(1999)是《Half-Life》的官方試玩版,包含完整版中沒有的三個獨特關卡。你扮演戈登·弗里曼,在研究設施中前所未見的區域裡,面對黑山事件的後續。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Headcrabs are weak to the crowbar — save ammo for bigger threats like vortigaunts and soldiers."
msgstr "頭蟹怕撬棍——把彈藥留給漩渦巨獸和士兵等更大的威脅。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/doom_shareware.ex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hold Shift to run — movement speed doubles, essential for dodging projectiles."
msgstr "按住Shift奔跑——移動速度加倍,對閃避投射物至關重要。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/chex_quest.ex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Included free in boxes of Chex cereal, it was the first video game ever distributed in a cereal box. Despite being a marketing gimmick, the 5-level campaign features surprisingly solid level design by Digital Café and has earned a devoted fanbase."
msgstr "它隨Chex麥片盒免費附贈,是史上第一款放在麥片盒中發行的電子遊戲。雖然只是行銷噱頭,但5個關卡的戰役中,Digital Café的關卡設計出乎意料地扎實,並贏得了一群忠實粉絲。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/quake2_shareware.ex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Inventory"
msgstr "物品欄"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_dreamweb.ex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Inventory management matters — you have limited carrying capacity, so choose wisely."
msgstr "物品欄管理很重要——你的攜帶能力有限,所以要明智選擇。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_bass.ex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Joey can be inserted into different robot bodies — some puzzles require specific robot forms."
msgstr "喬伊可以被裝進不同的機器人軀體——有些謎題需要特定的機器人形態。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:59
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Jump"
msgstr "跳躍"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Jump (PrBoom+)"
msgstr "跳躍(PrBoom+)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Last weapon used"
msgstr "上次使用的武器"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/chex_quest.ex:28
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:41
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:57
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:70
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/halflife_uplink.ex:27
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/rekkr.ex:28
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_dreamweb.ex:28
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_lure.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Left Click"
msgstr "滑鼠左鍵"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:209
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Left click interact/walk, Right click examine/verb menu, Drag inventory items to combine. F5 save/load, Ctrl+F5 options, Esc skip cutscene"
msgstr ""
"左鍵點擊交互/walk,右鍵點擊檢查/verb菜單,拖動目錄項目組合. F5 保存 /load, Ctrl+F5 選項, Esc 跳過切切換"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/librequake.ex:12
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "LibreQuake is a complete free and open-source replacement for Quake — original levels, models, textures, sounds, and music all created by the community under the BSD license. No commercial Quake files are needed."
msgstr "LibreQuake是Quake的完整免費開源替代品——原創關卡、模型、紋理、音效和音樂,全部由社群在BSD授權下製作。不需要任何商業版Quake檔案。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/librequake.ex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "LibreQuake runs on the same QuakeSpasm engine as the original, delivering full 3D gameplay with mouselook, jumping, and all the movement mechanics Quake is known for."
msgstr "LibreQuake與原作一樣執行在QuakeSpasm引擎上,提供完整的3D遊戲體驗,包含滑鼠視角、跳躍,以及Quake聞名的所有移動機制。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/librequake.ex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "LibreQuake uses original community-made assets — the weapons and enemies look different from Quake but play similarly."
msgstr "LibreQuake使用社群原創的素材——武器和敵人看起來與Quake不同,但玩法相似。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedoom2.ex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Like DOOM II, Phase 2 features larger, more complex levels with tougher enemy encounters. The Super Shotgun (weapon slot 3, alternate) makes its appearance here, and the level design takes full advantage of DOOM II's expanded monster roster."
msgstr "與 DOOM II 一樣,Phase 2 的關卡更大、更複雜,敵人的遭遇戰也更艱難。Super Shotgun(武器欄位 3,替代武器)在此登場,關卡設計也充分運用了 DOOM II 擴充後的怪物陣容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:38
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Listen for guards — you can hear enemies through doors before opening them."
msgstr "留意衛兵的動靜——開門之前,你就能隔著門聽到敵人的聲音。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_lure.ex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lure of the Temptress (1992) is Revolution Software's debut game — a medieval fantasy adventure featuring the innovative Virtual Theatre engine. The village of Turnvale has been conquered by the sorceress Selena and her army of orcs known as Skorl."
msgstr "Lure of the Temptress(1992)是 Revolution Software 的處女作——一款中世紀奇幻冒險遊戲,採用創新的 Virtual Theatre 引擎。Turnvale 村已被女巫 Selena 和她的獸人軍團 Skorl 征服。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_bass.ex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Made freeware by Revolution Software in 2003, Beneath a Steel Sky is widely considered one of the greatest point-and-click adventures ever made. It runs on ScummVM with full CD voice acting."
msgstr "Beneath a Steel Sky 於 2003 年由 Revolution Software 釋出為免費軟體,被廣泛認為是史上最偉大的指向與點擊冒險遊戲之一。它可在 ScummVM 上執行,並配有完整的 CD 語音。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_lure.ex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Made freeware by Revolution Software, Lure of the Temptress is a piece of adventure game history. While shorter and rougher than later Revolution games (Beneath a Steel Sky, Broken Sword), its autonomous NPC system was years ahead of its time."
msgstr "Lure of the Temptress 由 Revolution Software 釋出為免費軟體,是冒險遊戲史上的一部作品。雖然比後來的 Revolution 遊戲(Beneath a Steel Sky、Broken Sword)更短、更粗糙,但它的自主 NPC 系統領先時代數年。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_fotaq.ex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Made freeware by the developers, Flight of the Amazon Queen features full voice acting on the CD version. It runs on ScummVM and is considered one of the hidden gems of the 90s adventure game era."
msgstr "Flight of the Amazon Queen 由開發者釋出為免費軟體,CD 版本配有完整語音。它可在 ScummVM 上執行,被認為是 90 年代冒險遊戲時期的遺珠之一。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/freedm.ex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Maps are compact and weapon-dense — perfect for quick action sessions."
msgstr "地圖緊湊且武器密集——非常適合快節奏的短時間遊玩。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/catalog.ex:269
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Medieval fantasy adventure (1992)"
msgstr "中世紀奇幻冒險(1992)"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:47
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:62
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/wolfenstein_3d.ex:31
