#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_soltys.ex:12
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Soltys (1995) is a charmingly absurd Polish point-and-click adventure by LK Avalon. Your grandfather has been kidnapped by underground pirates, and you must rescue him by navigating a surreal world full of bizarre characters and creative puzzles."
msgstr "《Soltys》(1995)是 LK Avalon 製作的一款荒謬有趣的波蘭點擊式冒險遊戲。你的祖父被地下海盜綁架了,你必須穿越一個充滿奇特角色與創意謎題的超現實世界,把他救出來。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/scummvm_fotaq.ex:40
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Some puzzles have multiple solutions — experiment with different approaches."
msgstr "有些謎題有多種解法——不妨嘗試不同的做法。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:43
#: lib/retro_hex_chat/arcade/content/controls.ex:59
